window.products.push({"id":892152,"name":"Near and Deer Faux Taxidermy Rhino Head Wall Mount, White/Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":138.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N62+au9MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What a show-stopper! This exotic rhinoceros faux wall mount has been painted white and has a bronze horn. It is sure to add interest to any room and is a trendy conversation piece. Each piece is custom made to order, so please allow 2-4 business days for production. If you need the item sooner, message us and we will try our best to accommodate your needs. MEASUREMENTS:- 15\" tall- 9\" wide- 12\" deep. WEIGHT:- 6 lbs. HANGING INSTRUCTIONS:- Use a strong nail or screw - The antlers are removable to save space in shipping and storage- Glue the antlers in place before hanging to insure that they will not fall and break We love making custom rhino heads, please message us to start working on a unique piece! CUSTOMER SERVICE: Shop with confidence with Near and Deer. We work full-time on our shop to ensure that our faux taxidermy products are completed as quickly as possible with the highest possible quality. Our customer service is superior. We respond to messages and inquiries quickly; we are always excited to make custom orders (usually for no additional fee); and we are willing to rush your order if you need it by a certain date (again, usually at no additional cost). If for some reason you do have any issue with your purchase, we will correct it immediately. We also have a hassle free return policy, so you can shop with confidence. If the home decor piece you purchase is not exactly what you wanted or you just changed your mind, we will happily return or exchange it for you. We treat our customers how we want to be treated. PLEASE REVIEW OUR SHOP POLICIES BEFORE MAKING A PURCHASE SHIPPING INFORMATION:- For orders in the US, we ship USPS, UPS, or FedEx. Please let us know if your address requires a specific delivery method. - International orders are shipped via United States Postal Service. Your country may charge you import fees of VAT taxes that are not included in the shipping price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N62+au9MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Near and Deer","source_asin":"B00I3U0UEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3U0UEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3U0UEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
