window.products.push({"id":892194,"name":"BokiHuk LED Bathroom Mirror with Double Lights, 28 * 20 inch Vanity Makeup Mirror, Dimmable Anti-Fog LED Vanity Mirror with Backlit + Front Lighted, 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j6cV7B0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Newest Double Lights, Brighter】BokiHuk led mirror for bathroom gives out double brightness, both from the backsides and front. The led bathroom mirror adopts the latest energy-saving bright LED light, which provides a lifetime of over 80,000 hours (Using the LED mirror vanity 3 hours a day means it will last 73 Years). Purchasing our bathroom mirrors is a smart choice because you get the effect of 2 mirrors for the price of one. 【Tempered Glass & Aluminum material】Our bathroom mirror with light is made of ultra-white clear tempered glass material, light transmittance is better than ordinary glass, also, it can restore true color, CRI>90. Compared with other‘s led mirror, tempered glass material is more unbreakable and safe. The shell is made of aluminum material, and the waterproof and rust-proof material makes the lighted vanity mirror last for more than 50 years. 【3 Color Temperature and Fully Dimmable】Smart bathroom mirrors have 3 color temperature modes(warm light (3000K)/natural light (4000K)/white light (6000K)) to meet your makeup, grooming, shaving, lighting, and other daily needs. You can adjust the brightness from 0-100% to comfort your eyes. The smart memory function will record the lighting setting and keep the previous lighting status after turning it off and on. 【Anti-Fog & Touch Contral】The LED mirror has an automatic fog-free function. You do not need to wipe the steam on the mirror manually, only touch the defogging button before a hot shower, it needs 5-10 minutes to clear this lighted bathroom mirror completely. The touch screen design makes your home more technological, and the simple operation is also suitable for people of different ages. 【2 Installation Ways- Plugin / Wall Switch】Fixed the mirror holder on the wall with screws and hang the bathroom mirrors for vanity on the holder vertical or horizontal according to your space needs. There are 2 ways to install it: plug for power or connect the hard wire. It is better done by a professional electrician if you want to hardwire the mirror. TIP: Our plugs are not flat, if the socket is behind the mirror please consult a professional electrician or buyer before purchasing. 【Customer Service】We will provide a 30-Day Return policy and 3 years warranty for our bathroom vanity mirror. All BokiHuk lighted bathroom mirrors for wall had passed the rigorous drop, impact, and heavy pressure tests, but occasionally violent transportation occurs. Please contact us if you have any questions, and we will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j6cV7B0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BokiHuk","source_asin":"B0C6Y1HSXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6Y1HSXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6Y1HSXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
