window.products.push({"id":892254,"name":"LURRIER Assassins Teapot, Handmade Chinese Ceramic Tea Kettle, One Pot Three Drinks,Two Chambers Teapot, Drink Dispenser, Magic Trick Teapot with Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9134hgJj3bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Assassin's Teapot, also known as \"LiangXin Teapot\" in ancient Chinese history, \"LiangXin\" means two cores in one teapot, which stands for two different beverages in one pot. Original Story: It is a wine container used by Chinese nobles in ancient times for drinking & merrymaking, they are interested in tricking others with this tool during banquet, maybe that's the reason why someone is a better drinker than you:) Assassin's Tool:There is also a rumor about this \"LiangXin Teapot\", it's one of assassin favorite tools to assassinate their target, by using this teapot, they can easily mix regular beverage and poison together, and this caused most of injustices among nobles, trick or treat, that's the killer oath. Old Man Exterior:People may doubt about the figure of this teapot, and who is this old man? He is one of Eight Immortals of ancient Figures in Chinese Myths, and he represents God of longevity. People believes that he could bring wellness and wealth, LURRIER hope this teapot could also bring you extra joy to your family! CUSTORMER SERVICE: Risk-free to purchase, we provide 30 days free return and free replacement. If you received the crack product, please contact LURRIER Official. Hope you enjoy your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9134hgJj3bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LURRIER","source_asin":"B09TR7J8LL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TR7J8LL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TR7J8LL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
