window.products.push({"id":892375,"name":"Konoll Paring Knife - Pro Kitchen Knife 3.5 Inch Paring knife High Carbon German Stainless Steel Sharp Fruit Vegetable Knife with Ergonomic Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E2HyY-J6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SHARP AND CUTS PRECISELY The extraordinary quality German steel allows for easy blade maintenance and rapid sharpening for a razor-sharp edge. Nitrogen cooled for enhanced hardness, flexibility and corrosion resistance to assure your best cut. Triple riveted handle surrounds a full tang - Highly impervious to heat, cold and moisture. ERGONOMIC DESIGN, WELL BALANCED Ergonomic design for perfect balance, maximum comfort and best manipulation. PREMIUM GERMAN HC STAINLESS STEEL Premium German HC stainless steel enables chef’s knives wear-resistant, durable, rust and stain resistant. An exceptional combination of quality, design, materials and craftsmanship for the value-minded kitchen. Konoll 3.5 inch Fruit Knife is designed for professionals, including chefs, culinary experts, food caterers as well as ordinary person. It is a Multi-function knife, ideal for various tasks includes cutting,chopping, dicing and slicing vegetables, fruits, fish, meat and other products. KEY FEATURES High-quality, lightweight European steel. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Fit for dicing, mincing, chopping, slicing, and shredding. Long, sloping curved blade that “rocks” for effortless mincing and chopping. Flat spine for the extra power to slice through hard-skinned items. Non-slip handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Razor Sharp & Easy Cut With 15 degrees cutting edge and extreme hardness of HRC56+, this ultra sharp paring knife makes every cut and slice happy for vegetable, fruit. Ergonomic Handle Ergonomic design offers excellent balance and non-slip grip even with wet hands. Pakkawood handle of this professional kitchen fruit knife provides the multicolored styles as wood, but without the warping and splitting common in real wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E2HyY-J6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KONOLL","source_asin":"B08187F2JG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08187F2JG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08187F2JG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
