window.products.push({"id":892394,"name":"easuntec Baby Shark Toys,Baby Shark Party Supplies 3D Night Light with Timer Remote Control & Smart Touch 7 Colors Birthday Gifts for Boys Age 2 3 4 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLrp38UVL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"【Creative 3D Visual Effect】The night lights are made with 3d technology to create a gorgeous optical gorgeous 3d illusion with a realistic 3d Shark shape design, which is novelty and charming. It's bound to amaze and impress your kids and guests. It is a unique birthday, Christmas or Easter gifts for kid or friends. 【Timing Remote Control & Smart Touch】 The 3d night light comes with remote control and touch control to adjust the 7 different colors as you like. With the remote control, the Shark night light can be fixed in static or gradient color to decorate children's room, living room, bedroom, office, etc. 【Dual Power Mode】Our Shark night light for kids can be powered by 3-AA batteries(not included) or 5V USB cable connected to PC or your home adaptor(not included), which is very easy and convenient. It is a great creative decorative lights for children bedroom, living room, dinning room and outdoor decoration. 【Eco-friendly & Safety】The 3d toy Shark lamp for kids is made from Safe approved eco-friendly material, safe and harmless to the human body. The night light comes with soft, uniform, non-flicker light, making it safe to your kids, bringing them a nice sleep. It is a very human and practical kids night lights for bedroom. 【100% Money Back Guaranty】We offer 30-day money-back service and 12 months warranty for any quality issues. Any dissatisfaction with the 3d night light lamp within that period will be responded with a refund or a replacement. Please don’t hesitate to contact us if you have any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLrp38UVL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"easuntec","source_asin":"B07WZGS1SH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WZGS1SH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WZGS1SH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892395,"name":"Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags - Food Safe, Airtight Ziptop Stasher, Sandwich Snack Multipack Baggies to Pack Food Fresh - Food Grade Material of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aomxTDK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FRESHNESS YOU CAN TOTALLY COUNT ON When it comes to our families, we make no compromises . From the clothes on their back to the roof over their heads, we take no shortcuts. If we can do that for their clothes, house and education, we certainly will do the same for their food. Unfortunately, real life gets in the way of preparing a fresh meal for the family. We can't cook for them when they're on the road or in school. What we can do though, is the next best thing: preserve the freshness of our food. Enter the lovurate Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bag. It's made with high-quality food grade safe material , so any food you put in there stays fresh for hours and fit for your family's safety. All stasher reusable silicone bags are built tough to withstand multiple reuses , so it won't just tear on you the way flimsier bags do. Each set of 6 ziptop reusable silicone containers includes: - 2 large size silicone bags with 2 sliders - 4 medium size silicone bags with 4 sliders - 1 reusable stylish and functional canvas bag that can store all 6 stasher bags multipack - 1 instruction manual with step-by-step guide on how to use and maintain your baggies These bags are leak-resistant, airtight , and lock in the flavors of your food. They’re even versatile enough to fulfill a wide variety of uses, including sous vide. They can even withstand extreme temperatures from -40C to 250C. They are also freezer, microwave and dishwasher safe. Would you give your family anything less? Whether you need to keep your food fresh for the entire day, or you need to store them away for longer in the freezer, these bags have got you covered. Go with durability and versatility. Go with lovurate Reusable Silicone Bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aomxTDK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lovurate","source_asin":"B08RN7KCTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RN7KCTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RN7KCTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892396,"name":"Elite Home Renaissance 600-Thread-Count Cotton Sateen King Sheet Set, Cafe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h0uT8pGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious in feel and fashionable in color, these Renaissance sheets create a premium-quality bed without breaking the bank. Sewn from fine-woven 100 percent cotton, the sheets feature a lovely sateen weave, with most threads placed on the surface to create a glossy, lustrous shine. The hand feel is silky smooth yet the sheets are durable, and the thread-count of 600 is comparable to bedding in a high-end hotel. The set includes one fitted sheet, one flat sheet, and two pillowcases. The fitted sheet is fully elasticized for a secure fit, and its 16-inch pockets fit mattresses up to 18 inches deep. Both the flat sheet and the cases come with a 4-inch hem and marrow stitching for a fully finished look. The set is available in a range of sizes, and it washes up in the machine and tumbles dry for easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h0uT8pGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Home","source_asin":"B000BB6962","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BB6962","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BB6962","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
