window.products.push({"id":892414,"name":"20 Rustic Wood Place Card Holders | Place Card Holders For Weddings, Banquets, Parties, And More | Picture Holder, Table Card Holder, Or Table Number ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aNiUWXW5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you are looking for the perfect place card holder for your event, it can be a large task. Well look no further! We have created table number stands that are elegant and rustic, and they will be stunning at any event you are hosting! Rustic Yet Elegant Our wooden card holders will bring a rustic look with a touch of elegance to your event. The base of the rustic wood place card holders is genuine natural wood cut from the branches of real trees. There is an attractive silver wire inserted to act as a table number holder. Use for your wedding, party, banquet, special dinner or other event – our table number holders will meet your needs. Add a ribbon or the included rope to tie a bow and enhance the aesthetic of your rustic wedding decor. No need to worry about them blowing over either, as we’ve also included double-sided tape to hold the picture holder stand in place. Specifications The rustic wooden base of each place card holder measures approximately 1.6”. When combined, the base and metal place card holder stand approximately 5.8” tall. Note that each individual table number holder will be different in size, since they are made from natural materials. What You’ll Get 20 wooden table number holders (with wooden base and swirled wire number holder) 20 wooden table number holders (with wooden base and swirled wire number holder) 30 3.5x2” place cards (for writing name and table number) 30 3.5x2” place cards (for writing name and table number) Rope Rope Double-sided tape (to hold wooden numbers holders in place) Double-sided tape (to hold wooden numbers holders in place) ★ Be sure to get your rustic wood place card holders today, so that you have the best wedding or party table number holders!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aNiUWXW5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Party Den","source_asin":"B07YGMJ3GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YGMJ3GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YGMJ3GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
