window.products.push({"id":892428,"name":"Christmas Musical Snow Globe Lantern with 6H Timer & 8 Songs, USB Powered & Battery Operated, Lighted Glitter Snowglobe, Animated Snowman Holiday Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ax2UX+FkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Brighten Your Holiday Home - Green Christmas gift box snowglobe with red ribbon and glitter winter scene easily matches various room style, creating a very colorful holiday atmosphere. When you turn it on, it will illuminate your home with a warm white light, the snow starts to swirl, music starts to play, and your home starts to sparkle. ♬8 Classic Christmas Songs - Playlist: Jingle Bells, We Wish You A Merry Christmas, Silent Night, Deck The Halls, Joy To The World, The First Noel, Hark! The Herald Angel Sing, OH! Christmas Tree. They will be played on a loop with the perfect volume, filling the air with holiday music.estive green plastic casing, glittering pretty bow and the cute winter miniatures. The best choice to spark holiday joy for your lover. ⛄ Charming Winter Scene -Go join in the winter fun with snowman, squirrel, fox, rabbit and cardinal. Switch on and light up the snowglobe, the tiny glitters swirl gently, you will see the best snow falling and listen the traditional Christmas music. A perfect decoration for guaranteed holiday cheer. 👍Superior Function - Battery powered(3*AA batteries, excluded in package) or USB powered. 2 MODES: ①the bright snow fall and music feature work in unison.②only use the bright snowfall feature. TIMER ON and OFF: stay on for 6 hours, then off for 18 hours automatically. Automatically repeat the 6-H ON / 18-H OFF cycle every day. No need to turn it off manually. 🎁Secret Santa Gift - 1 Christmas gift box shaped musical snowglobe lantern with waving snowman and Christmas tree, 1 USB to DC cable and 1 User manual. The lighted snow globe features festive green plastic casing, glittering pretty bow and the cute winter miniatures. The best choice to spark holiday joy for your lover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ax2UX+FkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPOW","source_asin":"B0B9NSD5LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9NSD5LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9NSD5LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
