window.products.push({"id":892838,"name":"Fanjow® Cotton Linen Tablecloth Vintage Rectangular Lace Tablecloth Rectangle Dustproof Decorative Table Cover for Kitchen Dinning Tabletop (55\"*70\", ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Re2ExwfWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Introduction: √ The tablecloth is prepared from 100% cotton linen√ It will not stick your skin when having dinner,not hot and humid, breathable√ This is natural fashion tablecloth features elegant design in premitive linen fabric, which will add a touch of splash to any existing home decor, stain-resistant√ Multi-Size for choosing. Vintage and elegant, great idea to decorate your table√ Suitable for dinner table, coffee table, book desk, storage table etc., indoor, picnic or outdoor Features: ★ It will be your perfect companion for breakfast, lunch and dinner★ This elegantly designed tablecloth will increase the charm of the dining table★ Perfect for picnics, parties, dinners, everyday use and more★ Not only an elegant addition to your dining table but is also a great gift for a cherished someone Specification: Material: Cotton LinenStyle: Vintage, Rustic, Bohemian, EuropeanShape: RectangularCare Instructions: Machine wash on the delicate cycle with cold water and household detergent, hand wash best; lay flat to dry Available Size: 140cm*140cm/55\"*55\" 140cm*180cm/55\"*70\" 140cm*200cm/55\"*78\" 140cm*220cm/55\"*86\" 140cm*250cm/55\"*98\" How to Choose the Right Size? For Dining Table: Tablecloth Length =Table Length + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm); Tablecloth Width = Table Width + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm); each end drops approximately 8\" ~ 12\" (20 ~ 30 cm)For Tea Table: Tablecloth Length = Table Length + 8\"~16\"(20 ~ 40 cm); Tablecloth Width = Table Width + 8\"~16\"(20 ~ 40 cm); each end drops approximately 4\"~8\"(10 ~ 20 cm) Warm Prompt: √ Please allow 1-2 cm error due to manual measurement√ The picture may not reflect the actual color as different monitor display and light effect Package: 1*Cotton Linen Fabric Tablecloth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Re2ExwfWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fanjow","source_asin":"B0728NHYCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0728NHYCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0728NHYCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892839,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Rose Gold Graduation Class of 2023 Decorations Hanging Swirls - Set of 40","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BnzT2U61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Class of 2023 Party Decoration Swirls - Set of 40 includes 4 different shapes, 10 count per shape, that hang below an accordion-style spiral with included clear hooks. 10 swirls size 5 inches x 5 inches with length about 11 inches. 10 swirls, size 7.75 inches x 5.5 inches with length about 9 inches. 10 swirls, size 5 inches x 4.75 inches with length about 4 inches. 10 swirls, size 3 inches x 2.75 inches with length about 3.5 inches. Perfect for Graduation Parties: With different hanging lengths and a variety of shapes and sizes, Party Decoration Swirls are perfect for graduation parties. Add a pop of color when displayed over the gift table or dessert buffet. Or, add your own string if you would like them to hang lower in your party space. Easy to use: Each decoration swirl in the 40-piece set has a pre-cut hole for easy assembly using the included clear hooks. Party decoration swirls will arrive flat. Take a clear hook and insert the bottom bar into the pre-cut hole. Once the clear hook is fastened, gently stretch the swirl and hang it up. High-Quality Graduation Party Supplies: 2023 Rose Gold Graduation Party Decoration Swirls are professionally printed and double-sided on heavy-duty cardstock paper. They are individually cut, inspected, and carefully packaged. Each swirl will use one clear hook. Made in the USA: Graduation party decoration swirls are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Rose Gold Graduation Party Decoration Swirls uses a No-Mess Glitter Print: Our party kits are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BnzT2U61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B07RPBSJLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RPBSJLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RPBSJLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892840,"name":"Umbra Verge 1-Inch Drapery Rod for Window, 120 to 170-Inch, Auburn Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DzCIBcRoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Verge drapery rod set by Umbra includes a one-inch-diameter telescoping rod in an auburn bronze finish, two molded decorative finials and complete mounting hardware. Designed to fit a range of window sizes, the rod extends from 120-Inch to 170-Inch long using an auxiliary rod that fits inside the main rod for added length and support. Designed by Thea Yuzyk for Umbra - the worldwide leader in innovative, casual, contemporary and affordable design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DzCIBcRoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B00IZA2AK0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IZA2AK0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IZA2AK0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
