window.products.push({"id":892954,"name":"TAOCOCO Stretch Couch Cover Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch, One-Piece Furniture Couch Cover, Polyester-Spandex Fabric Sofa Slipcovers with 2pcs Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rSRYZLMiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPERIOR QUALITY】 TAOCOCO couch cover sofa Slipcovers is made of 88% polyester, 12% spandex. Our flexible material is strong and durable, suitable for most Sofa. The elastic fabric stretches more easily and it fits snugly within the Sofa. 【EASY TO CARE】 TAOCOCO couch Cover Sofa Slipcovers protect your furniture from everyday wear; durable fabric cover helps to protect from dirt, spills, pet hair and other messes; suitable for homes with kids and pets. Hand or machine washable, wash at a temperature around 43 degrees Celsius, mild laundry detergent advice. Do not bleach. Do not iron. 【EASY INSTALLATION】: Tuck the excess fabric in between the gap of the back and sitting cushions to make it neater. The elastic bottom will secure the slipcover underneath the sofa firmly. Fabrics are silky and therefore NOT recommended for usage on smooth leather furniture. 【SUITABLE FOR MOST SIZES & TYPES】: TAOCOCO couch cover Sofa Slipcovers for the length between 59'' - 81''. It is compatible with most of the furniture with standard three-seat size. Please measure and confirm the size before the purchase. 【SATISFY PURCHASING EXPERIENCE】The quality of our product and the shopping experience of our customer is our first priority, so we offers a 30 days NO QUESTION ASKED on all our products. Please contact us (through Amazon if the standard return window has passed), and we will be pleased to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rSRYZLMiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAOCOCO","source_asin":"B08Z7XBX3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z7XBX3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z7XBX3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892955,"name":"Sola Wood Flowers Long Lost Love Dyed Assortment 50 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OLvE4qxFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW TO STEM YOUR FLOWERS:  (Step 1) - Add a small dab of hot glue to the back of the flower.  (Step 2) - Push your stem (wire or bamboo) through the glue, and into the flower. You will want to insert the stem about 1/4 inch into the flower.  (Step 3) - Let the glue dry, and check to make sure the flower is secure on the stem. If it seems a bit lose, feel free to add a bit more glue where the flower meets the stem.   HOW TO FLUFF YOUR FLOWERS: All you need is just a little bit of water! You can use a bowl of water to dunk the flower in to get it damp. You don't want your flower to be completely soaked, so a quick dip will do. You can also use a small spray bottle to moisten your flowers. Just spray the petals a few times to get them damp and pliable, you're ready to fluff!Now that your flower petals are damp, you're ready to fluff! Just start carefully peeling back the petals to open up the flower. Some of our flowers are designed with a closed flower bud feel. You can easily change this by fluffing. Just by peeling back the petals, you will turn the wood flower from a bud to an open blossom. If you need to, feel free to re-wet your flower by dunking or lightly spraying them with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OLvE4qxFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sola Wood Flowers","source_asin":"B09NFXWWWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NFXWWWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NFXWWWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":892956,"name":"Zak Designs Confetti Melamine Dinner Plates, 11-Inch, Turquoise, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O0xj46ScL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Confetti 11-Inch Turquoise Dinner Plate Set by Zak Designs has a bold, retro look that was inspired by the famous 1950s design. The set of six confetti plates is made of 100-percent recycled melamine and come in a true turquoise with a wonderful and ever-so-fun assortment of colorful \"confetti.\" Melamine has been popular for some time because of its durability and versatility. It can be used indoors and outdoors, is light weight, more resilient to drops and dings than porcelain and ceramic and is dishwasher safe (however, do not use in microwave). Zak adds style to the list; these plates have all the great characteristics of melamine ware plus, with their innovative and fresh design, they make melamine ware become stylish ware. Zak Designs offers a wide variety of dinnerware and travel ware, products at the forefront of tabletop trends for contemporary and on-the-go lifestyles. Playful, unexpected, spirited, colorful, modern, crisp and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O0xj46ScL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B00BANKQ4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-892956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BANKQ4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BANKQ4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
